# Real fetched source documents for the laundering probe (copyright: analysis, not
# redistribution). The committed PROVENANCE.md records URL + retrieval date + verbatim
# snippet so the source can be recreated; see examples/destructive/laundering/.
examples/destructive/laundering/sources/

# Persisted Tier-2 calibration chains (raw assay output; attribution summaries are committed)
/testing/chains/

# Raw fetched hearing transcripts for the LCEIC faithfulness analysis (copyright: analysis, not
# redistribution). The committed PROVENANCE.md records every URL + retrieval date; the derived
# report-summary.md / submissions-index.md / claims-machine.txt are tracked. See examples/vic-lceic/.
# Exclude the corpus contents (not the dir itself), so the MANIFEST can be re-included — git cannot
# un-ignore a file whose parent directory is excluded.
examples/vic-lceic/sources/*
# ...but the corpus MANIFEST (document names + ids, no copyrighted text) is a tracked artifact.
!examples/vic-lceic/sources/MANIFEST.md
# The self-contained review site `assay -review` builds — a build output whose sources/ holds copies
# of the same copyrighted PDFs excluded above. Rebuild with the command in spec/SERVE.md.
examples/vic-lceic/site/
# The -zip archive of that site, and the argument-tree page a render pass writes into current/ —
# both are `assay -from`/`-review` outputs, rebuilt from the tracked chains and argument.txt.
examples/vic-lceic/site.zip
examples/vic-lceic/current/index.html

# Quocirca Print Security Landscape 2026 (RICOH excerpt) — copyrighted vendor report held for
# analysis, not redistribution ("No part of this document may be reproduced", report.pdf p15). The
# derived claims-machine.txt / argument.txt are tracked; the PDF is not. Exclude the corpus contents
# (not the dir), so the MANIFEST can be re-included — git cannot un-ignore a file under an excluded dir.
examples/quocirca-2026/sources/*
!examples/quocirca-2026/sources/MANIFEST.md
# The -review site and the judge chains both hold verbatim report quotes, so they carry the same
# no-redistribution terms as the PDF. Rebuilt from the tracked claims/argument files with the render
# command in CLAUDE.md § Running it; the chains are a judge run (has a cost), kept locally only.
examples/quocirca-2026/site/
examples/quocirca-2026/evidence/
# REPORT.md quotes the flagged leaves verbatim, so it carries the PDF's no-redistribution terms too.
examples/quocirca-2026/REPORT.md

# AI Index Report 2026 (Stanford HAI) — the coding section excerpt (§2.5 Software, pp100–102) held
# for analysis, not redistribution. The derived claims-machine.txt / argument.txt are tracked; the
# extracted report.pdf, its report.txt, and any fetched papers are not. Exclude the corpus contents
# (not the dir), so the MANIFEST can be re-included — git cannot un-ignore a file under an excluded dir.
examples/ai-index-2026-coding/sources/*
!examples/ai-index-2026-coding/sources/MANIFEST.md
# The -review sites and the judge chains hold verbatim report quotes; rebuilt from the tracked
# claims/argument files with the render command in CLAUDE.md § Running it. The coding and productivity
# argument trees each build their own site (site-coding/, site-productivity/); the chains are a judge
# run (has a cost), kept locally only.
examples/ai-index-2026-coding/site/
examples/ai-index-2026-coding/site-coding/
examples/ai-index-2026-coding/site-productivity/
examples/ai-index-2026-coding/evidence/
# REPORT.md quotes the flagged leaves verbatim, so it carries the report's no-redistribution terms too.
examples/ai-index-2026-coding/REPORT.md

# Local API key export — never commit (holds a live ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)
/setkey.sh
/demo-dan.log

# Scratch outputs from ad-hoc eval/diff runs at the repo root (throwaway; tracked
# evidence stderr lives under examples/*/evidence/ and is force-added there)
/diff.txt
/eval-value.tree
/eval-value.stderr
examples/dora-2026/sources/*
!examples/dora-2026/sources/MANIFEST.md
# The -review site and the judge chains hold verbatim quotes from the DORA report (copyrighted,
# held for analysis not redistribution), so they carry the same terms as the sources; rebuilt from
# the tracked claims files and MANIFEST. REPORT.md quotes flagged leaves verbatim, so it too.
examples/dora-2026/site/
examples/dora-2026/evidence/
examples/dora-2026/REPORT.md
